假设您想要构建一个简单的待办事项列表应用程序。下面是如何使用 List 视图显示任务列表的示例:

```swift
struct ContentView: View {
  let tasks = ["Task 1", "Task 2", "Task 3", "Task 4", "Task 5"]

  var body: some View {
    List(tasks, id: \.self) { task in
      Text(task)
    }
  }
}
```

